{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Trash Sorter Simulator, you'll experience the oddly addicting world of professional waste management. As you sort through society's discards, you'll discover that some secrets are waiting to be found.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/60afab47f4003478d418c92237e507d3.poster.avif?t=1756136777\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/60afab47f4003478d418c92237e507d3.webm?t=1756136777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Art of Recycling</strong> Learn and apply complex recycling protocols as you sort waste into multiple categories: paper, plastic, glass, hazardous waste, electronics, and residual waste. Each item requires  proper categorization. Make mistakes and lose money - excel and unlock new sorting facilities with increasingly complex waste streams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/16b9bafa78640f1fe9942274f53f12b0.poster.avif?t=1756136777\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/16b9bafa78640f1fe9942274f53f12b0.webm?t=1756136777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/16b9bafa78640f1fe9942274f53f12b0.mp4?t=1756136777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Facility Management</strong> - Upgrade equipment, unlock automation, and earn money faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/acb4de0c30133ca2f797379224988f97.poster.avif?t=1756136777\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/acb4de0c30133ca2f797379224988f97.webm?t=1756136777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/acb4de0c30133ca2f797379224988f97.mp4?t=1756136777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a Compelling Mystery</strong> What starts as a simple job becomes an intriguing journey. Strange items can be discovered in the waste stream. Dig deeper into the facility's trash so you can piece together the truth about your employer, your purpose, and why you can't remember anything before your first day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/82375905729656b68e9173927d7c8d2a.poster.avif?t=1756136777\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3884360/extras/82375905729656b68e9173927d7c8d2a.webm?t=1756136777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Six Figure Sorter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884360/ac2a79e85ed5bad6200f5f2f669fe22c3de31eaf.jpg"},{"name":"State of the Art Facility","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884360/0710e6eaf8f4bdd93b5231b5185ba69c0c5e9f79.jpg"},{"name":"Truth in the Trash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3884360/4d128d065a617cecb667328d7edc6c45237789a0.jpg"},{"name":"Heating Up","path":"ht